rs/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":126539,"digest":"sha256:79a779d0548badb35534abbedb4548ebd16c02c66e1f67add52a0557622f2e25","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-09T09:27:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T09:27:00Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jappyjan/bobs-factory/releases/download/v1.0.0-beta/validation-receipts.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jappyjan/bobs-factory/tarball/v1.0.0-beta","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jappyjan/bobs-factory/zipball/v1.0.0-beta","body":"Bob’s Factory’s first public beta provides a self-hosted software factory with a protected browser dashboard, project and prepared-agent onboarding, durable workflows and native GitHub delivery.\n\nInstall on macOS or Linux (Apple Silicon/Intel, ARM64/x64 with glibc):\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://jappyjan.github.io/bobs-factory/install.sh | sh\n~/.local/bin/bobs-factory\n```\n\nThe installer verifies the native archive and manifest and retains prior versions. Installing the factory requires no GitHub login, GitHub CLI, Node, npm or Bun. Your chosen coding agent has its own preparation and authentication requirements; Cursor remains user-prepared and is excluded from distributed archives.\n\nFour native CI builds passed installed startup, dashboard/assets, protected API/MCP, shutdown/restart, scoped helper and mocked agent protocol checks. Release testing uses mocks; live authenticated provider tests were not run and require separate explicit manual approval. Full-payload controlled F1, preservation and exact source/rebuild evidence accompany this beta.\n\n- Immutable source: [`3e117128`](https://github.com/jappyjan/bobs-factory/commit/3e117128f77ecf256b1f7866f65906b33c83e9fb)\n- [Full CI](https://github.com/jappyjan/bobs-factory/actions/runs/37906394417)\n- [Four-target native builds](https://github.com/jappyjan/bobs-factory/actions/runs/37906510201)\n- [Website and installation guide](https://jappyjan.github.io/bobs-factory/#start)\n\nAttached assets include all four binaries and SHA-256 manifests, the public installer and verifier, shared release metadata, native receipts, validation evidence and complete source/rebuild material. This is a prerelease; Windows and musl/Alpine are not supported. Apache-2.0 upstream attribution and third-party notices are retained.\n"}